      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Logging tidied up to report updates to storage, index etc as errors (and also include pid in messages).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Object removal code moved to separate method, with a \"failSafe\" parameter; true indicates warn only, false indicates we were doing a purge and therefore any error removing artefacts is an error condition.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We could in future change behaviour to throw an exception if a purge fails; or would it be better to report the error and continue (since the repository can still be used; albeit with potential inconsistences in the storage).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
